        about_statistics_text: "STATISTICS\n\nA detailed view of your gaming history and habits.\n\n- Overview: Total games, favorites, collections, and launches.\n- Play Time: Shows your total time played across the whole library.\n- Top 5 Most Played: Games with the highest accumulated play time.\n- Top 10 Most Launched: Games you have opened the most times.\n- Recently Played: The last 5 games you launched.\n- Collections Breakdown: Shows how many games you have per console."
